          "suggestions": "The agent skipped the expected confirmation steps (iot.sites and iot.asset_ids) before calling iot.latest_reading, and made a redundant acetylene-only latest_reading call even though acetylene was present and non-null in the newest record. Otherwise the data (timestamp 2024-01-19, age ~85.18M s / ~986 days), the exclusion of CO2/O2/N2, and the Condition 1 comparison (H2, CH4, C2H6, C2H4, C2H2 exceed; CO does not) are all correct and clearly presented. In future, verify site/asset existence first and only fetch the acetylene-specific reading when it is actually missing from the newest record."
